      "text": "Remove only the small rectangular wall poster immediately to the right of the dark salon doorway beside the central staircase. Fill only that patch with the surrounding distressed wall texture. Preserve the camera, stairs, bar, shelving, all openings, high right window, neon tubes, floor, perspective, colours, lighting and every other detail. Add nothing.",
